{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove your worth in this <strong>brutal Action-Adventure</strong> inspired by <strong>Heroic Fantasy Classics</strong>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crush your enemies</strong>, struggle against fate and become the usurper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every victory, as well as defeat, depends more on your own combat prowess, rather than the strength of your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine every combat tactic at your disposal. Whether you prefer <strong>attacking</strong> head-on, <strong>defending</strong> strategically, <strong>parrying</strong>, <strong>dodging</strong> or <strong>counterattacking</strong>, you can adapt your playstyle without being constrained by any class-specific stats.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Skill-based, Brutal Combat</strong> - Combine various strikes to break your enemies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/shortaction1.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enemies\u00a0</strong>- Face opponents who will keep you on your toes and challenge your tactics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/2024-02-0621-47-26-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Weapons</strong> - Crush, slice, stab or fist your way through your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Distinct Environments</strong> - Travel from grim dungeons to snowy temples in a series of semi-open levels. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/walksnow2.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679830?t=1744144336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/cb009e12d15d9c8a184aa23eac19240e72bf452d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744144336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/4967168e0a9275f54b3cc4c439396811a55bb876/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744144336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/4967168e0a9275f54b3cc4c439396811a55bb876/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744144336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes combat-based action adventure gameplay with depictions of dismemberment. Players will encounter scenes where enemies are partially dismembered during combat. The game does not focus on explicit or graphic violence beyond this mechanic. There are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3525110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove your worth in this <strong>brutal Action-Adventure</strong> inspired by <strong>Heroic Fantasy Classics</strong>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crush your enemies</strong>, struggle against fate and become the usurper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every victory, as well as defeat, depends more on your own combat prowess, rather than the strength of your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine every combat tactic at your disposal. Whether you prefer <strong>attacking</strong> head-on, <strong>defending</strong> strategically, <strong>parrying</strong>, <strong>dodging</strong> or <strong>counterattacking</strong>, you can adapt your playstyle without being constrained by any class-specific stats.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Skill-based, Brutal Combat</strong> - Combine various strikes to break your enemies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/shortaction1.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enemies\u00a0</strong>- Face opponents who will keep you on your toes and challenge your tactics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/2024-02-0621-47-26-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Weapons</strong> - Crush, slice, stab or fist your way through your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Distinct Environments</strong> - Travel from grim dungeons to snowy temples in a series of semi-open levels. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/walksnow2.gif?t=1744144336\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sverun"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/2619bfb6a7fe67e6b50b5499a6cc550bb2b20e0c/header.jpg?t=1744144336","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":2571